Symmetric voltage divider, operating point

// Hand translation of ../circuit.sp. VACASK has no SPICE netlist reader — its
// deck language is a different language, not a dialect — so every VACASK
// column in the benchmark comes from a deck written beside the SPICE one and
// held to it line for line:
//
//   Vin in 0 DC 10   ->  vin (in 0) v dc=10
//   R1  in out 5k    ->  r1  (in out) r r=5k
//   R2  out 0 5k     ->  r2  (out 0) r r=5k
//   .op              ->  analysis op1 op
//
// Nothing is added and nothing is dropped: a VACASK deck that is not the same
// circuit turns a third opinion into a fourth wrong answer.

ground 0

load "resistor.osdi"

model r resistor
model v vsource

vin (in 0) v dc=10
r1 (in out) r r=5k
r2 (out 0) r r=5k

control
  options rawfile="binary"
  analysis op1 op
endc
